# RANGER.RC -- what Enter opens in RANGER, by the file's extension.
#
# One rule a line: the extension, then the command; RANGER adds the
# file's name after it.  The first rule that matches wins.  A file no
# rule names opens in VI.  .PRG and .COM files always run.
#
# EDIT knows BBC BASIC (its keywords, Ctrl+R renumbers); PROG builds
# Pascal and C.  Change a line to suit.
PAS PROG
BAS PROG
C   PROG
H   PROG
K4P PROG
